This product is an independent reimplementation intended to interoperate with
workflows and data formats used by Polyrate. Polyrate is developed by the
Truhlar group and collaborators. The Polyrate 2023 reference distribution is
available under the Apache License 2.0; its manual and associated publication
have their own stated attribution terms.

No Polyrate source archive or manual is bundled in this repository. Small test
snippets may reproduce factual input/output values solely for compatibility
verification and retain their source attribution in the corresponding test or
documentation.
